  m_text: '- Grind wheat with mortar and pestle.

    - Drop flour into bowl with
    some water.

    - Mix, drop spoon and grab some dough.

    - Leave dough in
    oven for 2 minutes.

    - Throw sliced fruit into a pot of water.

    - Mix
    while ingredients are heated.

    - Spread the jam on some toast. Done!'
